:: Deadwood Coin Zephyr Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-coin-zephyr-link'>>
  <<deadwood-coin-context>>
  <<if !_coinReady or $combat or !_coinCave.found or !C.npc.Zephyr.init or !['Pirate Zephyr', 'Smuggler Pub Zephyr', 'Deadwood Coin Cave'].includes($passage)>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<if $passage is 'Deadwood Coin Cave' and (!_coinCave.together or !_coinCave.voyage)>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink `_coinCave.zephyrCoins gt 0 ? ['Discuss returning the gold', '商量归还金币'] : ['Ask about the island cavern', '提起海岛洞窟']` 'Deadwood Coin Zephyr'>>
    <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat>>
      <<if $passage isnot 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><<set _coinCave.origin to $passage>><</if>>
      <<set _coinCave.scene to ''>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-coin-zephyr-agree'>>
  <<deadwood-coin-context>>
  <<if !_coinReady or $combat or !_coinCave.bound or _coinCave.zephyrCoins lte 0 or _coinCave.agreed or !C.npc.Zephyr.init>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<if _args[0] is 'proof' and !(_coinCave.journal or _coinCave.inscription or _coinCave.appraised)>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<if _args[0] is 'crew' and !($pirate_rank is 1 or C.npc.Zephyr.love gte 20)>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<if _args[0] is 'pay'>>
    <<if $money lt _coinCave.zephyrCoins * 6000>><<exit>><</if>>
    <<money `-_coinCave.zephyrCoins * 6000`>>
  <<elseif !['proof', 'crew'].includes(_args[0])>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<set _coinCave.agreed to true, _coinCave.scene to _args[0]>>
  <<if $location is 'island'>><<deadwood-coin-cave-time 5>><<else>><<pass 5>><</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Coin Zephyr
<<effects>><<deadwood-coin-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Coin Zephyr'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !_coinReady or $combat or !_coinCave.found or !C.npc.Zephyr.init>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The captain cannot discuss this now.' '船长现在无暇谈这件事。'>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<npc 'Zephyr'>><<person1>>
  <<if _coinCave.zephyrCoins gt 0>>
    <<if _coinCave.agreed>>
      <<switch _coinCave.scene>>
        <<case 'proof'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              You tell Zephyr what you have learned about the gold. <<He>> listens, then takes a coin from the pouch and turns it between <<his>> fingers.
              <br><br>
              "Can't even taste me rum. Not much use keeping gold if this is the price." <<He>> drops the coin back into the pouch. "We put the lot back. And nobody keeps a souvenir."
            <<option 'CN'>>
              你把查到的线索告诉泽菲尔。<<He>>听完，从钱袋里取出一枚金币，放在指间转了转。
              <br><br>
              “连酒都尝不出味了。留着这些金子还有什么用？”<<He>>将金币丢回钱袋。“全数放回去。谁也不许留一枚当纪念。”
          <</language>>
          <<if _coinCave.visited.includes('inscription_deep')>>
            <br><br>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                You show the captain the gesture you learned from the carvings. Zephyr studies your hands. "Still following orders after all this time, eh? Keep that trick ready when we go back. I'd rather not waste a blade on bones."
              <<option 'CN'>>
                你做出石刻里见过的手势。泽菲尔盯着你的手看了片刻。“死了这么久，还认这套规矩？回去时记得用上。老子可不想拿好刀去砍骨头。”
            <</language>>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'crew'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>You remind Zephyr that the crew will notice something is wrong with their captain. Barking orders will not explain it forever.<<else>>You lower your voice and ask how Zephyr plans to explain the missing heartbeat to the crew. This is more than a story told over rum.<</if>>
              <br><br>
              Zephyr narrows <<his>> eyes. "Don't tell me how to run me ship." <<He>> looks down at <<his>> pale hand. After a moment, <<he>> adds, "...Bring the gold. We settle this. Leave the crew to me."
            <<option 'CN'>>
              <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>你提醒泽菲尔，船员迟早会发现船长的异样。到时候，恐怕不是骂上几句就能压住的。<<else>>你压低声音，问泽菲尔打算怎么向船员解释没有心跳的事。海上的传闻不少，这一件可就发生在他们眼前。<</if>>
              <br><br>
              泽菲尔眯起眼睛。“用不着你教老子怎么管船。”<<He>>看着苍白的手背，沉默片刻。“……带上金币，把这事了结。船员那边我去说。”
          <</language>>
        <<case 'pay'>>
          <<lanSwitch 'Zephyr counts the money twice. "Aye, that covers me share. The gold goes back in the chest. Every piece." The captain ties the pouch shut and keeps it close.' '泽菲尔把钱数了两遍。“行，抵了我的分成。金币得全放回箱子，一枚也不能少。”船长扎紧钱袋，仍贴身收着。'>>
        <<default>>
          <<lanSwitch '"Every last coin," Zephyr says, tapping the pouch. "Let\'s get this cursed business over with."' '“一枚都不能少。”泽菲尔拍拍钱袋。“走吧，赶紧把这事了结。”'>>
      <</switch>><br><br>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if $location is 'island'>>Zephyr drinks from <<his>> flask, then spits onto the ground.<<else>>Zephyr drinks some rum, then pushes the mug away.<</if>> <<His>> face is as pale as yours. "Bloody hell. Might as well be drinking ditch-water. Can't taste a thing."
          <br><br>
          You mention the gold. <<He>> puts a hand over <<his>> pouch. "Want me to throw it back? Show me that it'll get me heart beating. I'm not giving up me share on a guess."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if $location is 'island'>>泽菲尔喝了口酒，皱着眉吐在地上。<<else>>泽菲尔喝了口酒，烦躁地推开杯子。<</if>><<His>>脸色和你一样苍白。“见鬼，连酒味都尝不出来。”
          <br><br>
          你提起那些金币。<<He>>立刻按住钱袋。“想让老子把金子扔回去？先证明这能让心脏重新跳起来。没个准信，别想动我的分成。”
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<if _coinCave.journal or _coinCave.inscription or _coinCave.appraised>>
        <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Explain the evidence (0:05)', '说明查到的线索 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Coin Zephyr'>><<deadwood-coin-zephyr-agree 'proof'>><</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if $pirate_rank is 1 or C.npc.Zephyr.love gte 20>>
        <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Discuss what this means for the crew (0:05)', '谈谈这件事对船员的影响 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Coin Zephyr'>><<deadwood-coin-zephyr-agree 'crew'>><</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if $money gte _coinCave.zephyrCoins * 6000>>
        <<icon 'pound.png'>><<lanLink ['Offer to cover the share (0:05)', '出钱补上这份分成 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Coin Zephyr'>><<deadwood-coin-zephyr-agree 'pay'>><</lanLink>> · <<printmoney `_coinCave.zephyrCoins * 6000`>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<lanSwitch '"We can take another look at the place if ye fancy," the captain grumbles. "Just keep your hands off me pouch until I say otherwise."' '“再跑一趟也行，”船长说，“但我没答应之前，别碰我的钱袋。”'>><br><br>
    <</if>>
  <<elseif _coinCave.bound>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Zephyr watches you feel for your pulse. "Took something from that cave, did ye? Find someone who knows old coins. Or go back and see what the last owner left behind."' '泽菲尔看着你摸着手腕寻找脉搏，扯了扯嘴角。“从洞里拿东西了，是吧？找个懂古钱币的人看看，或者回去找找上一个倒霉鬼留下的东西。”'>><br><br>
  <<elseif _coinCave.returns gt 0>>
    <<lanSwitch '"Still got a pulse? Good." Zephyr glances at your hands. "Next time you go treasure-hunting, find a chest that only needs a bloody key."' '“还有脉搏？那就好。”泽菲尔看了看你的手。“下回寻宝，挑个只要撬锁就能开的箱子。”'>><br><br>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Zephyr listens as you describe the mooring ring and the steps cut into the cliff. "Old unloading place. Could be stores, could be plunder." <<He>> rubs <<his>> chin. "Show me the way. If there's real coin in the dark, we split it fair and square. But don't take that to mean you can help yourself to me ship's cargo."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        泽菲尔听你说起岩壁间的古老系船铁环和隐秘台阶。“旧卸货点。可能存着补给，也可能有赃物。”<<He>>摸摸下巴。“带路吧。真找着金子，按规矩分。别以为这就能随便动我船上的货。”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>

  <<if _coinCave.crewCoins gt 0>>
    <<lanSwitch '"Gave two pieces to the sailors who rowed us in," Zephyr grunts. "Leave \'em to me. Nobody starts a panic aboard me ship."' '“给划船的水手各分了一枚，”泽菲尔说，“我去找他们。别在船上传得人心惶惶。”'>><br><br>
    <<if _coinCave.agreed and $location isnot 'island'>>
      <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Have Zephyr recall the crew shares (0:30)', '请泽菲尔收回船员手里的金币 (0:30)'] 'Deadwood Coin Zephyr'>>
        <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat and _coinCave.agreed and _coinCave.crewCoins gt 0 and $location isnot 'island'>>
          <<set _coinCave.zephyrCoins += _coinCave.crewCoins, _coinCave.crewCoins to 0, _coinCave.scene to 'recalled'>><<pass 30>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<elseif _coinCave.scene is 'recalled'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Zephyr tosses the two coins into the pouch with a heavy clink. "Both back. Told the lads they\'ll get proper sterling once we finish this business."' '泽菲尔把两枚金币丢进钱袋。“都在这儿了。等这事办完，再拿现钱补给他们。”'>><br><br>
  <</if>>

  <<if _coinCave.voyage and !_coinCave.together and $location is 'pirate_ship' and $pirate_journey gt 1>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The ship is bound for the island. The captain will call you when the landing comes into view.' '船正在驶向海岛。见到那处登陆点时，船长会叫上你。'>><br>
  <<elseif !(_coinCave.voyage and _coinCave.together and $location is 'island') and !(_coinCave.agreed and _coinCave.crewCoins gt 0)>>
    <<icon 'anchor.png'>><<lanLink `_coinCave.zephyrCoins gt 0 and _coinCave.agreed ? ['Arrange a voyage with both shares', '带齐双方的金币并安排前往海岛的航程'] : ['Arrange an expedition to the cavern', '安排一同前往洞窟的航程']` `$location is 'pirate_ship' ? 'Pirate Deck' : 'Pirate Smuggler Entrance'`>>
      <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat and C.npc.Zephyr.init>>
        <<set _coinCave.voyage to true, _coinCave.together to false, _coinCave.scene to ''>>
        <<if $location isnot 'pirate_ship' or $pirate_journey is undefined>><<set $pirate_journey to 7>><</if>>
        <<if $pirate_rank isnot 0 and $pirate_rank isnot 1>><<set $pirate_rank to 0, $phase to 1>><</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><<note `lanSwitch('About a week', '约一周')` 'blue'>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return', '返回'] `_coinCave?.voyage and _coinCave?.together and $location is 'island' ? 'Deadwood Coin Cave' : (_coinCave?.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Pirate Zephyr' : 'Smuggler Pub Zephyr')`>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Coin Voyage Arrival
<<location 'pirate_ship'>><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<deadwood-coin-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Coin Voyage Arrival'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !_coinReady or $combat or !_coinCave.voyage or _coinCave.together or $pirate_journey gt 1>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the deck', '返回甲板'] 'Pirate Deck'>><</lanLink>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc 'Zephyr'>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Zephyr lowers <<his>> telescope and points towards a break in the cliffs. "That yer mark? We'll anchor here. No need to tell the islanders what we're after."
    <br><br>
    Two sailors lower a boat. The captain checks the rope, then motions you towards the ladder. "Keep the way back clear. I'm not leaving me ship out here all day."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    泽菲尔放下望远镜，指向崖壁间的一道缺口。“是你留的记号？就在这儿下锚。咱们来找什么，不用让岛上那些家伙知道。”
    <br><br>
    两名水手放下小艇。船长检查过缆绳，朝绳梯偏了偏头。“记住回来的路。老子可不打算在这儿耗上一整天。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<icon 'coin-cave/old-cavern.png'>><<lanLink ['Row to the marked landing (0:20)', '乘小艇前往留有记号的登陆点 (0:20)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>>
  <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat and _coinCave.voyage and !_coinCave.together and !($pirate_journey gt 1)>>
    <<set _coinCave.together to true, _coinCave.room to 'mouth', _coinCave.scene to '', $location to 'island'>><<unset $pirate_journey>><<endevent>><<island_pass 20>>
  <</if>>
<</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Stay aboard', '留在船上'] 'Pirate Deck'>>
  <<if _coinReady and !$combat>><<set _coinCave.voyage to false>><</if>>
<</lanLink>><br>
